<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39416" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιθει-άζὠ</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>call upon in the name of the gods, adjure,
			conjure</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">το σαῦτα</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιθειάσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.75
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. μὴ κατάγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					8.53
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ λόγῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Them.</u>
					28
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>.
			<i>inspire</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.580d
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				589d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				37.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>. abs., <i>to
				be inspired, prophesy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				1.31
			</span></i>: </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b>. acc. cogn., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοιαῦτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					4.6.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>ascribe
				to divine influence</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς πράξεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.579f
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VS</u>
				1.10
			</span></i>; <i>treat with reverence</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				4.1.108
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Chr.</u>
				39
			</span></i>.</div>
